msgid "已知限制"
msgstr "Known Limitations"

msgid "平台"
msgstr "Platforms"

msgid ""
"VMware 验证未完成；物理硬件未验证。QEMU 的成功只证明指定拓扑与用例。 PCI 设备 BAR 使用独立映射窗口，但设备仍可能受 CPU 物理地址位数、 BAR "
"描述及缓存别名规则限制。64 TiB 直映射窗口是设计上限，未验证 该容量的物理内存或硬件；实际可分配量还受固件拓扑及元数据限制。 活动 EFI amd64 交接的固件表须同时通过 EFI "
"内存描述符覆盖及当前页表 身份映射的证明；内核自行退出启动服务后仍保留此证明。启动服务已在交接前 结束时，描述符本身不能证明高地址身份映射；i386 入口只建立前 4 GiB 的 "
"身份映射，无法证明可达的固件表和平台身份信息会报告不可用。 编译压力桌面交互、长期稳定性、完整本机自举及全部恢复路径未完成整版验收。 GPU 支持限于已实现的设备与能力，不等于通用 Linux "
"DRM 驱动兼容。"
msgstr ""
"VMware validation is incomplete; physical hardware is unvalidated. Success in QEMU proves only the"
" specified topology and cases. PCI device BARs use a separate mapping window, but devices may "
"still be limited by CPU physical address width, BAR descriptions, and cache aliasing rules. The 64"
" TiB direct-map window is a design ceiling; that amount of physical memory and hardware have not "
"been validated, and actual allocatable memory also depends on firmware topology and metadata. "
"Firmware tables in an active EFI amd64 handoff require proof of both EFI memory descriptor "
"coverage and identity mapping in the current page tables; this proof is retained after the kernel "
"exits boot services itself. If boot services ended before handoff, descriptors alone do not prove "
"identity mapping at high addresses. The i386 entry establishes identity mapping only for the first"
" 4 GiB; firmware tables and platform identity information whose accessibility cannot be proven are"
" reported as unavailable. Desktop interaction under compilation load, long-term stability, "
"complete native self-hosting, and all recovery paths have not passed full-release acceptance. GPU "
"support is limited to implemented devices and capabilities and does not imply general Linux DRM "
"driver compatibility."

msgid "接口与测试"
msgstr "Interfaces and Tests"

msgid ""
"驱动 API 保留 168 字节历史前缀，当前版本 2 的总长为 304 字节；追加字段 由独立夹具校验，旧版本描述符在初始化前拒绝。原始 golden 不重生成， "
"不修改音频支持清单掩盖失败。部分旧 fixture 与总测试存在 独立失败，定向测试通过不能称为完整 ABI 或 POSIX 认证。 CPU 统计精度仍为 10 ms，不包含独立 "
"IRQ、softirq、iowait 和完整子进程统计。"
msgstr ""
"The driver API preserves its historical 168-byte prefix; the current version 2 has a total size of"
" 304 bytes. Appended fields are checked by independent fixtures, and older-version descriptors are"
" rejected before initialization. Original golden data is not regenerated, and audio support lists "
"are not changed to conceal failures. Some legacy fixtures and the overall test suite have "
"independent failures; passing targeted tests cannot be called full ABI or POSIX certification. CPU"
" statistics still have 10 ms precision and do not include separate IRQ, softirq, iowait, or "
"complete child-process statistics."
